{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01140",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.33,
      "end_seconds": 6.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Well, hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.33,
      "end_seconds": 12.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 18.12,
      "end_seconds": 25.12,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "Doctor, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.55,
      "end_seconds": 38.57,
      "duration_seconds": 12.02,
      "text": "Mainly pins and needles in my hands and feet. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.21,
      "end_seconds": 41.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 46.42,
      "end_seconds": 66.56,
      "duration_seconds": 20.14,
      "text": "Let me think, you know, she is on Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar, I give it to her. It's omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day for the reflux, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.94,
      "end_seconds": 71.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "So, since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 72.87,
      "end_seconds": 80.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "For two months. Yeah, it's aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.8,
      "end_seconds": 83.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "When did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 83.84,
      "end_seconds": 85.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "about about a year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.74,
      "end_seconds": 95.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I used to take pantoprazole, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.32,
      "end_seconds": 99.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.46,
      "end_seconds": 108.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "about about a month, give or take"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 109.36,
      "end_seconds": 113.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Erm, it was closer to about two months, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.46,
      "end_seconds": 120.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Okay, so so roughly one to two months. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.46,
      "end_seconds": 126.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Yeah, roughly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.52,
      "end_seconds": 134.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "so, is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.63,
      "end_seconds": 162.83,
      "duration_seconds": 26.2,
      "text": "It happens a few times a day. I've been forgetting words too, for two months. As for feeling very tired, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. About feeling very tired, severe, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.4,
      "end_seconds": 187.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "let me check a few things any rash, diarrhoea or loss of vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.57,
      "end_seconds": 193.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "No, you know, no rash, diarrhoea or loss of vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.72,
      "end_seconds": 201.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Did you get weight loss or bladder problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.6,
      "end_seconds": 206.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.88,
      "end_seconds": 209.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.73,
      "end_seconds": 218.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.48,
      "end_seconds": 223.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.51,
      "end_seconds": 227.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "So, my grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.44,
      "end_seconds": 237.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.34,
      "end_seconds": 251.22,
      "duration_seconds": 11.88,
      "text": "Diabetes, for about a year. Acid reflux, for about ten years. Okay, so I have heart disease, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.8,
      "end_seconds": 257.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Okay, I can see acid reflux in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.9,
      "end_seconds": 267.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.89,
      "end_seconds": 273.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Ah, no, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.03,
      "end_seconds": 277.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "so, anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.25,
      "end_seconds": 284.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "Yes, I had my womb taken out, fifteen years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.43,
      "end_seconds": 288.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.68,
      "end_seconds": 312.63,
      "duration_seconds": 22.95,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I smoke roughly a pack every two days. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.97,
      "end_seconds": 318.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "shall I check your blood pressure and and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.78,
      "end_seconds": 329.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.2,
      "end_seconds": 352.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "okay: blood pressure 114 over 74, temperature 36.9, heart rate 70, oxygen saturation is 99 percent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.01,
      "end_seconds": 355.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.48,
      "end_seconds": 360.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.38,
      "end_seconds": 367.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.76,
      "end_seconds": 370.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 386.74,
      "end_seconds": 390.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Your vibration sense is reduced at the the ankles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 392.11,
      "end_seconds": 394.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 407.68,
      "end_seconds": 410.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "The tongue looks smooth and red."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 416.03,
      "end_seconds": 442.56,
      "duration_seconds": 26.53,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Taking everything into account, it's hard to say. Symptoms that fit a vitamin B12 deficiency is one possibility and diabetic nerve damage another, and I'd rather not commit yet. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had pins and needles in your hands and feet, and no bladder problems or diarrhoea."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 443.62,
      "end_seconds": 445.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 446.12,
      "end_seconds": 450.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Have you had any tests for this so so far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 454.81,
      "end_seconds": 464.37,
      "duration_seconds": 9.56,
      "text": "I had a thyroid test done at another clinic last year i don't have the report with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 469.47,
      "end_seconds": 499.44,
      "duration_seconds": 29.97,
      "text": "I want a vitamin B12 level done, that's for tingling and tiredness. Let's get a full blood count, for tiredness. You'll be taking cyanocobalamin, 1000 micrograms, every other day, for two weeks. That's for low vitamin B12. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. Eating more eggs, dairy and fortified cereals will help over time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 500.91,
      "end_seconds": 513.96,
      "duration_seconds": 13.05,
      "text": "If you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that. Book a review after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 514.91,
      "end_seconds": 519.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "I, I'll note it it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 519.85,
      "end_seconds": 524.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 524.71,
      "end_seconds": 528.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Thank you, you know, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 529.53,
      "end_seconds": 530.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}